description: goose SQL migrations
globs: "{backend/migrations/**,backend/cmd/migrate/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Migrations

- Tool: pressly/goose v3 via `backend/cmd/migrate`
- No silent auto-migrate in prod unless `AUTO_MIGRATE=true`
- Every `apps/backend/migrations/*.sql` file must keep goose section markers: `-- +goose Up`, `-- +goose Down` (and `StatementBegin`/`StatementEnd` when used). Never strip them as "comments".
